{"title":"2025 IMO Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2><p>\nLet <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/e/a1e6cd0e4103015efba12e0fc4291f012b467eaa.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathbb{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> denote the set of positive integers. A function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/e/0ce842cdbbf03dc953ff2bd7e432e30a0451f265.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f: \\mathbb{N} \\rightarrow \\mathbb{N}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"82\" height=\"18\" /> is said to be <i>bonza</i> if </p><center><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/c/1acc6639de4f1c620680bec4adf3e668f4db723f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/6/3a62c227f1f37fe4e9f88ab23c8026f90209bfb3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^{a} - f(b)^{f(a)}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"99\" height=\"23\" /></center><p> for all positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />. Determine the smallest real constant <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/1/f11659b54ad4fa38611b6fbf9804489ccb5ff573.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(n) \\leq cn$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"81\" height=\"20\" /> for all bonza functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/2/bb2c93730dbb48558bb3c4738c956c4e8f816437.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"13\" height=\"18\" /> and all positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_solution\">Video solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Video solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vPqUTG4CW8w\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=vPqUTG4CW8w</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HZtoYgF3ZQ4\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HZtoYgF3ZQ4</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IMO_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IMO\" title=\"2025 IMO\">2025 IMO</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions,_with_authors\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions, with authors\">IMO Problems and Solutions, with authors</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competitions_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competitions resources\">Mathematics competitions resources</a></li></ul>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IMO\" title=\"2025 IMO\">2025 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IMO_Problems\" title=\"2025 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2025 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IMO_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2025 IMO Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2025 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2025 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2025 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2025_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2025 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018032629\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications